#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:4
#: 383fad07f82b4ef5aff70aa579d7acee
msgid ""
"A program that watches teleoperation subscribes to the topics on this "
"page. Each section gives the topic, the message type, the QoS, the "
"namespace, and the fields. Headset buttons and the RViz card stay on [VR "
"Teleoperation](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)."
msgstr "监视遥操作的程序订这一页的话题。每一节给出话题、消息类型、QoS、命名空间和字段。头显按键和 RViz 卡片在 [VR 遥操作](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:6
#: 1a2791edb3e546c28aafa181336e9d26
