" and [section 1 of the message README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)."
msgstr "定义见 [`TeleopModeState.msg`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/TeleopModeState.msg)、[`TeleopMode.msg`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/TeleopMode.msg)、[`Inputs.msg`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/Inputs.msg)，以及 [消息 README 第 1 节](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)。"

