#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:17
#: b77b8556b23149ce810794a8f08ac336
msgid ""
"Send the change on the command topic. The mode that is active now is only"
" on the status topic. `teleop/controller_state` carries the event code. A"
" `0` on that topic means this frame had no button edge. UPDATE, STORAGE, "
"pause, and mirror are fields of `TeleopModeState` on `teleop/mode_state`."
msgstr "改模式发在命令话题上。当前生效的模式只在状态话题上。`teleop/controller_state` 带的是事件码。该话题上的 `0` 表示这一帧没有按键边沿。UPDATE、STORAGE、暂停和镜像是 `teleop/mode_state` 上 `TeleopModeState` 的字段。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:19
#: 7696bbeb7db44b828f5ffc188d59732c
msgid ""
"A dexterous hand, DualHand, or a UI reads `teleop/mode_state` for an "
"event-bus session, or `teleop_mode` when it follows the joystick or the "
"keyboard. The foot pedal publishes `teleop/controller_state` only."
msgstr "灵巧手、DualHand 或界面在事件总线会话里读 `teleop/mode_state`；跟随手柄或键盘时读 `teleop_mode`。脚踏板只发布 `teleop/controller_state`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:21
#: 111d41b17b4e446999cb300dbaf7d41f
msgid "Namespace and QoS"
msgstr "命名空间与 QoS"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:23
#: 847bf71d6bea40b49db574b0bf342b3f
msgid ""
"The command and status names above are relative to the robot namespace. "
"With no namespace the event-bus status topic is `/teleop/mode_state`. In "
"namespace `/robot_a` it is `/robot_a/teleop/mode_state`. Subscribe in "
"that same namespace. Two robots in one scene stay apart."
msgstr "上面的命令名和状态名相对机器人命名空间。没有命名空间时，事件总线的状态话题是 `/teleop/mode_state`。命名空间 `/robot_a` 下是 `/robot_a/teleop/mode_state`。在同一个命名空间里订阅。同一场景里的两台机器人互不串扰。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:25
#: 506aa58f823542c3883f7ac0cf98e6bb
msgid ""
"QoS is `Reliable` + `TransientLocal`. The status publisher sends one "
"message at startup, then another when a field changes. A node that starts"
" later still receives the last snapshot."
msgstr "QoS 为 `Reliable` + `TransientLocal`。状态发布端启动时发一条，字段变化时再发一条。后启动的节点仍能收到上一次快照。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:27
#: 427b9bb3592d4d25a99740d303d63d64
msgid "ros2 topic echo /robot_a/teleop/mode_state"
msgstr "ros2 topic echo /robot_a/teleop/mode_state"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:31
#: 11d21a74f3084c92975ece3617ada269
msgid ""
"With an empty namespace, echo `/teleop/mode_state`. Match QoS `Reliable` "
"+ `TransientLocal` on the subscription."
msgstr "命名空间为空时，echo `/teleop/mode_state`。订阅端使用同样的 QoS `Reliable` + `TransientLocal`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:33
#: 05c3bbcc6d834285b41529b1009cb6ae
msgid ""
"Headset pose, stick axes, and trigger pull are the root names in [VR "
"published topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md#vr-published-"
"topics) (`/teleop/head_pose`, and the rest of that set). "
"`teleop/mode_state` follows the robot namespace."
msgstr "头显位姿、摇杆轴和扳机行程是 [VR 发布话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md#vr-published-topics) 里的根名称（`/teleop/head_pose`，以及这一组里的其余话题）。`teleop/mode_state` 跟随机器人命名空间。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:35
#: 5527481203c74b6fa9a0ea73c04db87c
msgid "Event-bus status (`TeleopModeState`)"
msgstr "事件总线状态（`TeleopModeState`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:37
#: 3651c29030b0420fb1de56168d7abc2d
msgid ""
"`TeleopModeState` on `teleop/mode_state` is the latch for the event bus. "
"`VRInputHandler` publishes it after a field changes. The message is the "
"current mode. It does not say which button produced the last event. "
"`TeleopMode` is a different message, for the joystick and the keyboard."
msgstr "`teleop/mode_state` 上的 `TeleopModeState` 是事件总线的锁存。`VRInputHandler` 在字段变化后发布它。这条消息就是当前模式。上一次事件来自哪个按键，不在这条消息里。`TeleopMode` 是另一条消息，给手柄和键盘用。"

