#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:55
#: 48bc84bfab324ef3961f2f1f604ffc28
msgid ""
"Read `mirror_movement` for mirror. Read pause, the gripper-mode flags, "
"`update_mode`, and `topology` when the hand or the UI needs them. "
"Open/close and percent commands stay on `*/target_command` and "
"`*/target_percent`. This message reports which gripper mode is latched. "
"It does not carry the gripper command."
msgstr "镜像读 `mirror_movement`。手或界面需要时再读暂停、夹爪模式、`update_mode` 和 `topology`。开合和比例命令仍在 `*/target_command` 和 `*/target_percent`。这条消息报告锁存的夹爪模式，夹爪命令不在这条消息里。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:57
#: cd03dacd80ca4d759df797c319827df4
msgid "Arm pause and WBC arm enable"
msgstr "手臂暂停与 WBC 手臂使能"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:59
#: 92a0dbb86e6544489c61faf5a34cfa9f
msgid ""
"`left_arm_paused` and `right_arm_paused` are teleop pause. WBC arm enable"
" is `left_arm_state` and `right_arm_state` on "
"`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` (`WbcCurrentState`). An arm can be "
"VR-paused and still be `ARM_ENABLED`."
msgstr "`left_arm_paused` 和 `right_arm_paused` 是遥操暂停。WBC 手臂使能是 `/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`（`WbcCurrentState`）上的 `left_arm_state` 和 `right_arm_state`。一条手臂可以处于 VR 暂停，同时仍是 `ARM_ENABLED`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:61
#: 896593aa51324f9bb052dd8097c497f0
msgid ""
"On 全身, event 16 switches what left **Y** / right **B** mean. After that "
"switch, the current meaning is `yb_pause_semantics`. `left_arm_state` and"
" `right_arm_state` stay the WBC enable bits. The button chord is on [Stop"
" one arm vs stop sending VR "
"commands](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md#stop-one-arm-vs-"
"stop-sending-vr-commands)."
msgstr "在全身下，事件 16 切换左 **Y** / 右 **B** 的含义。切换之后，当前含义是 `yb_pause_semantics`。`left_arm_state` 和 `right_arm_state` 仍是 WBC 的使能位。按键组合见 [停单臂 vs 停发指令](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md#stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-commands)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:63
#: 619641cc503449719437b59df1ff08f0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Field values for `WbcCurrentState`: {ref}`wbc-current-state`. Mode "
"strings on `/mode_command`: {ref}`wbc-mode-command`. `/mode_command` is "
"`std_msgs/String` on the 全身 stack. It is not a write path for "
"`current_state`."
msgstr "`WbcCurrentState` 各字段的取值见 {ref}`wbc-current-state`。`/mode_command` 上的模式字符串见 {ref}`wbc-mode-command`。`/mode_command` 在全身栈上是 `std_msgs/String`。写入 `current_state` 不走这条话题。"

