msgstr "没有手臂目标，也没有 VR 夹爪命令。最近一次 VR 位姿会留到下一次 UPDATE"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:74
#: 7dec8e2e635e4bda80cc0e83e60e85d6
msgid ""
"Right stick click toggles the two, and only while FSM is **OCS2**. In "
"STORAGE, joystick and keyboard `hand_command` on `control_input` can "
"still open and close the hand. While UPDATE is on, the VR trigger stream "
"keeps writing the gripper."
msgstr "右摇杆按下在两者之间切换，且仅当 FSM 为 **OCS2**。STORAGE 下，手柄和键盘在 `control_input` 上的 `hand_command` 仍能开合手。UPDATE 打开时，VR 扳机流持续写夹爪。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:76
#: f99e405f1b1b4650bd5592bbc50d4ef2
msgid "Joystick and keyboard (`TeleopMode`)"
msgstr "手柄与键盘（`TeleopMode`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:78
#: f5386b7a9d6f4bceb56236ec405b45d7
msgid ""
"`TeleopMode` on `teleop_mode` is the latch for the joystick and the "
"keyboard. Same QoS: once at startup, again when `active`, `control_mode`,"
" `mirror_movement`, or speed changes. Switching the active arm does not "
"republish this message."
msgstr "`teleop_mode` 上的 `TeleopMode` 是手柄和键盘的锁存。QoS 相同：启动时一次，`active`、`control_mode`、`mirror_movement` 或速度变化时再发。切换当前手臂不会重发这条消息。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:27
