#: fa9a1aba452c443f8d2d98f1286edd30
msgid ""
"The active arm is `Inputs.target` on `control_input` (`1` left, `2` "
"right), not a field of `TeleopMode`. In chassis mode the joystick may "
"pause the periodic `Inputs` stream. Keep the last `target`. Enable switch"
" and the keyboard keys: [Joystick "
"teleop](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md)."
msgstr "当前手臂是 `control_input` 上的 `Inputs.target`（`1` 左，`2` 右），不是 `TeleopMode` 的字段。底盘模式下手柄可能暂停周期性的 `Inputs` 流。保留最近一次 `target`。使能开关和键盘按键见 [手柄遥操作](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:91
#: 6534cb38ced24fdf836307e650d181e6
msgid "`Inputs` on `control_input` is the command stream for that path."
