#: 712d53c105e343589a6994ce722a1712
msgid ""
"Names, types, and rates for the headset stream are [VR published "
"topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md#vr-published-topics). That "
"stream is the root `/teleop/...` set from `xr_target_node`. The current "
"mode is still `teleop/mode_state`, not a value on "
"`/teleop/controller_state`."
msgstr "头显流的名称、类型和频率见 [VR 发布话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md#vr-published-topics)。那一组是 `xr_target_node` 发出的根话题 `/teleop/...`。当前模式仍是 `teleop/mode_state`，不是 `/teleop/controller_state` 上的某个值。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:106
#: b3b7f0a9844f416aab43a8921b83062c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Optical wrist presets also publish `/teleop/optical_r0_caps`, "
"`/teleop/optical_r0_request`, `/teleop/optical_r0_ready`, and "
"`/teleop/mirror_mode`. The handshake is in "
"[PROTOCOL_CN.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/vr_pose_publisher/blob/main/docs/PROTOCOL_CN.md). The dexterous-hand "
"joint command on that path is `q_des` ([xr_hand_retarget "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/xr_hand_retarget/blob/main/README.md)). Launch and the headset panel:"
" {ref}`Hand tracking <vr-hand-tracking>`."
msgstr "光学腕预设还会发布 `/teleop/optical_r0_caps`、`/teleop/optical_r0_request`、`/teleop/optical_r0_ready` 和 `/teleop/mirror_mode`。握手在 [PROTOCOL_CN.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/vr_pose_publisher/blob/main/docs/PROTOCOL_CN.md)。这条路径上的灵巧手关节命令是 `q_des`（[xr_hand_retarget README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/xr_hand_retarget/blob/main/README.md)）。启动和头显面板见 {ref}`手部追踪 <vr-hand-tracking>`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:108
#: 560860c421f34a2c97b0eb3ff8fcb568
msgid ""
"Wuji glove topics are on [wuji_glove_teleop](5-wuji_glove.md). Vive "
